{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人李佳芯（Ali）與林愷鈴（Ashley）今日（26日）出席汽車活動，有多年駕駛經驗的Ali，覺得7人車很舒適會適合開工，不過平日自己會鍾情以小車代步，貪其相對靈活，擁「棍波牌」的她更笑稱自己初考獲駕照時，駕駛風格很「辣」，不過現在已收斂</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:43:43.705954+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:23:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:36:57.015172+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:36:57.015172+00:00","content_hash":"d174e2cf36214bc160d2314fa2a266504f6597794d3abd938b1a8e1f3be2101a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}